{"id":"cabo","lemma":"cabo","pos":"noun","rank":989,"glosses":["end, edge, extremity (furthest or terminal point of something)","end, finish, conclusion (terminal point of something in time)","stub, butt, stump (something blunted, stunted, burnt to a stub, or cut short)"],"ipa":"/ˈkabo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cabos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-cabo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Llevó a cabo su propio plan.","en":"He carried out his plan.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/526927","words":[{"g":"to take somewhere","l":"llevar"},{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"own"},{"g":"plan"}]},{"text":"Es importante que lleve esto a cabo.","en":"It's important I do this.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611764","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"important"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to take somewhere","l":"llevar"},{"g":"this"},{"g":"to"},null]},{"text":"A ver si podemos llevarlo a cabo.","en":"Maybe we can work something out.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611827","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"to prune","l":"podar"},{"g":"to take somewhere","l":"llevar"},{"g":"to"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"I wonder if"]]},{"text":"No podemos dejar cabos sueltos.","en":"We can't leave any loose ends.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to prune","l":"podar"},{"g":"to leave"},null,{"g":"free, loose, undone","l":"suelto"}]},{"text":"Al fin y al cabo no voy a ir.","en":"I'm not going anyway.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454827","words":[null,null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to go"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"at last"]]}]}